{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And houses</b> — four times in the Masorah. One is here, and the others: בתים מלאים כל טוב (houses full of every good thing), וחמדו שדות וגזלו בתים ונשאו (and they coveted fields and robbed houses and carried them off), ובתים מאין אדם (and houses without a person). If you keep His commandments, you find בתים מלאים כל טוב and בתים טובים תבנה (you build good houses); but if your heart grows haughty and you rob fields and houses — then ובתים מאין אדם."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:13.853022471Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}